  "details": "Accessibility issues in the VRChat 2026.4.2 (OPEN BETA) release notes.\n\nThe lede that reads aloud as \"six seven plus slash eighty five asterisk slash eighty five asterisk slash ... asterisk slash eighty. Five asterisk.\" is completely unneeded and confusing for the non-visual reader. Please just get rid of this annoyance and avoid it altogether.\n\nSteps to reproduce: Ctrl + Shift + U in Microsoft Edge to use the Read Aloud feature.\n\nAffected URL: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202642-open-beta\n\nSee the attached video.\n\nOn the video, the feedback URL is also read out as \"feedback vrchat dot com\" instead of as \"feedback dot vrchat dot com\".",
